are-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=39591&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&stateRegion=all&ver=11","why":"A service worker is what makes offline access, caching, and background sync possible."},{"id":"pwa-theme-color","label":"Theme color declared","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=39591&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&stateRegion=all&ver=11","why":"Theme color controls the browser chrome/status-bar color when the site is installed or bookmarked."},{"id":"pwa-apple-touch-icon","label":"Apple touch icon (iOS/bookmark icon)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=39591&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&stateRegion=all&ver=11","why":"iOS uses this icon for home-screen bookmarks and \"Add to Home Screen\" — without it the icon falls back to a screenshot."},{"id":"manifest-parsed","label":"Manifest fetched and parsed successfully","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=39591&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&stateRegion=all&ver=11","why":"A manifest that fails to parse cannot drive installability or launch behavior even if the link is present."},{"id":"manifest-maskable-icon","label":"Manifest declares a maskable icon","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=39591&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&stateRegion=all&ver=11","why":"A maskable icon lets the OS safely crop/mask the app icon on different device shapes without clipping content."},{"id":"sw-active","label":"Service worker is active (not just registered)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=8&contractorNumber=all&lcdi